stateDiagram-v2
[*] --> NEW: new Station()
NEW --> RUNNABLE: start()
RUNNABLE --> TIMED_WAITING: sleep(ms)
TIMED_WAITING --> RUNNABLE: time elapsed
RUNNABLE --> WAITING: join() / wait()
WAITING --> RUNNABLE: notify / joined thread ends
RUNNABLE --> BLOCKED: waiting for a monitor lock
BLOCKED --> RUNNABLE: lock acquired
RUNNABLE --> TERMINATED: run() returns
TERMINATED --> [*]
